Process Oversight Outcome

54
00:03:10,169 --> 00:03:14,729
based oversight might result in
specification gaming. Process based

55
00:03:14,729 --> 00:03:18,050
supervision on the other hand,
theoretically mitigates this problem

56
00:03:18,050 --> 00:03:20,530
to a large extent by being more likely to

57
00:03:20,530 --> 00:03:24,610
produce correct and legible reasoning. It
encourages models to

58
00:03:24,610 --> 00:03:27,889
follow a process endorsed by humans and
directly rewards

59
00:03:27,889 --> 00:03:31,090
an aligned sequence of smaller steps
rather than relying

60
00:03:31,090 --> 00:03:34,650
on outcomes as a proxy for aligned
behavior. Generally

61
00:03:34,650 --> 00:03:38,090
for fuzzy tasks, process based supervision
might be a

62
00:03:38,090 --> 00:03:41,449
more appropriate method to pursue, for
example, when we

63
00:03:41,449 --> 00:03:44,689
need to verify the chain of mathematical
reasoning. Research

64
00:03:44,930 --> 00:03:49,009
so far has found that process supervision
significantly outperforms

65
00:03:49,009 --> 00:03:52,289
outcome supervision for training models to
solve problems. For

66
00:03:52,289 --> 00:03:56,969
math based tasks, process based
supervision might similarly result

67
00:03:56,969 --> 00:04:00,169
in more aligned outcomes for other complex
chains of

68
00:04:00,169 --> 00:04:03,129
